coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder workspace-proxy regenerate-token [flags] <name|id>

  Regenerate a workspace proxy authentication token. This will invalidate the
  existing authentication token.

OPTIONS:
  -c, --column [id|name|display name|icon url|healthy|url|wildcard hostname|derp enabled|derp only|proxy status|proxy report|proxy checked at|created at|updated at|deleted|version|proxy token] (default: name,url,proxy token)
          Columns to display in table output.

      --only-token bool
          Only print the token. This is useful for scripting.

  -o, --output text|json|table (default: text)
          Output format.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
